Architecture: aarch64_generic
Installed-Size: 20480
Filename: kmod-hwmon-adcxx_6.18.40-r1_aarch64_generic.ipk
Size: 4028
SHA256sum: d093fc3241eee14454acc5612e639d7ddfe011c52fea1e1f9f66ca69b1bce6a9
Description:  Kernel module for the National Semiconductor
 ADC<bb><c>S<sss> chip family, where
 * bb  is the resolution in number of bits (8, 10, 12)
 * c   is the number of channels (1, 2, 4, 8)
 * sss is the maximum conversion speed (021 for 200 kSPS, 051 for 500
 kSPS and 101 for 1 MSPS)
 
 Examples : ADC081S101, ADC124S501, ...

